OL,3,GNEWSATwo brothers convicted over
OL,4,AChristmas Day killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo brothers have been convicted after
OL,7,Fa man was stabbed to death in
OL,8,FWolverhampton on Christmas Day.
OL,10,FTrey Johnson, 30, died in the early
OL,11,Fhours of 25 December last year after
OL,12,Fsuffering a single stab wound to his
OL,13,Fchest, West Midlands Police said.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
