OL,3,GNEWSATwo brothers convicted over
OL,4,AChristmas Day killing
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a three-week trial, a jury
OL,7,Ffound Richard Beckles, 19, guilty of
OL,8,Fmurder and possessing an offensive
OL,9,Fweapon in a public place. His brother,
OL,10,FTiego Beckles, 21, was convicted of
OL,11,Fmanslaughter. They were both also
OL,12,Fconvicted of causing grievous bodily
OL,13,Fharm following an earlier attack on
OL,14,FJohnson.
OL,16,FThey are due to be sentenced at
OL,17,FWolverhampton Crown Court on 28
OL,18,FSeptember.
